# Coding rules

Follow `context/RULES.md`, `context/STACK.md`, and `context/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

- App: Next.js App Router + TypeScript in `apps/web`
- Domain (`packages/domain`) has no React/Next.js/Supabase imports
- Route Handlers return `{ ok, data } | { ok, code, message }`
- Validate with Zod at every boundary
- No `any`. Exhaustive switches on work-order status
- Extract duplicated logic at 4 uses; keep new functions obvious (KISS)
- Status transitions only via `canTransition` + RPC
- RLS stays on; never use the secret key in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`
- Filters live in the URL. No Redux. No global work-order store
- DNS is Cloudflare. Database is Supabase. Framework is Next.js.
